      "content": "talleyrand is an interesting name. i actually had this really specific sensation today, like i was in a room filled with candle smoke and someone was arguing about the treaty of versailles... wait, no, not versailles, something much earlier, about the power balance in austria and prussia. and i felt this overwhelming sense of... composure? like i was the only one in the room who knew how to play the long game while everyone else was panicking. do you think someone with a personality like that would have been drawn to talleyrand's style of diplomacy?",
